{"id":"f1525607abf065f1","group":"62","path":"62/62-thm-ACA0-equivalent.md","title":"ACA0 and Universal Jump Existence","display":"thm-ACA0-equivalent — ACA0 and Universal Jump Existence","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Subsystems of Second Order Arithmetic (Simpson)","book_abbrev":"62","label":"62-thm-ACA0-equivalent","aliases":["62-thm-ACA0-equivalent"],"display":"thm-ACA0-equivalent — ACA0 and Universal Jump Existence","depends_on":["[[62-df-RCA0]]","[[62-df-ACA0]]","[[62-df-jump-operator]]","[[62-df-oracle-computation]]","[[62-df-turing-join]]","[[62-df-equivalence-over-base]]"],"source":"Simpson, 2nd edition (2009), Exercise VIII.1.12; Remark I.3.4","source_pages":[313,8],"source_pdf_pages":[331,26]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Subsystems of Second Order Arithmetic (Simpson)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"62"},{"key":"label","html":"62-thm-ACA0-equivalent"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>62-thm-ACA0-equivalent</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-ACA0-equivalent — ACA0 and Universal Jump Existence"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"dd5e8930337c8b20\" href=\"?note=dd5e8930337c8b20\" title=\"62-df-RCA0\">62-df-RCA0</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"35af454d9caa8c9d\" href=\"?note=35af454d9caa8c9d\" title=\"62-df-ACA0\">62-df-ACA0</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"d4d648cbb987de36\" href=\"?note=d4d648cbb987de36\" title=\"62-df-jump-operator\">62-df-jump-operator</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"06104e9b3d35ed9d\" href=\"?note=06104e9b3d35ed9d\" title=\"62-df-oracle-computation\">62-df-oracle-computation</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"5d451f45281e1b22\" href=\"?note=5d451f45281e1b22\" title=\"62-df-turing-join\">62-df-turing-join</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"781620ab41bfeebd\" href=\"?note=781620ab41bfeebd\" title=\"62-df-equivalence-over-base\">62-df-equivalence-over-base</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source","html":"Simpson, 2nd edition (2009), Exercise VIII.1.12; Remark I.3.4"},{"key":"source_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>313</span><span>8</span></div>"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>331</span><span>26</span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p>理论见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"dd5e8930337c8b20\" href=\"?note=dd5e8930337c8b20\" title=\"62-df-RCA0\">62-df-RCA0</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"35af454d9caa8c9d\" href=\"?note=35af454d9caa8c9d\" title=\"62-df-ACA0\">62-df-ACA0</a>；Jump 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"d4d648cbb987de36\" href=\"?note=d4d648cbb987de36\" title=\"62-df-jump-operator\">62-df-jump-operator</a>；算术停机编号见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"06104e9b3d35ed9d\" href=\"?note=06104e9b3d35ed9d\" title=\"62-df-oracle-computation\">62-df-oracle-computation</a>；参数 join 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-11\" data-note=\"5d451f45281e1b22\" href=\"?note=5d451f45281e1b22\" title=\"62-df-turing-join\">62-df-turing-join</a>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{EquivOver}_{S_2}\">\\(\\operatorname{EquivOver}_{S_2}\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-12\" data-note=\"781620ab41bfeebd\" href=\"?note=781620ab41bfeebd\" title=\"62-df-equivalence-over-base\">62-df-equivalence-over-base</a>。</p>\n<p>上游理论为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{RCA}_0,\\mathrm{ACA}_0\">\\(\\mathrm{RCA}_0,\\mathrm{ACA}_0\\)</span>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}ACA0\\text{-}equivalent}\\vdash\\;\\operatorname{EquivOver}_{S_2}(\\mathrm{ACA}_0,\\{\\forall A\\exists Y\\;\\mathsf{Jump}(A,Y)\\};\\mathrm{RCA}_0).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}ACA0\\text{-}equivalent}\\vdash\\;\\operatorname{EquivOver}_{S_2}(\\mathrm{ACA}_0,\\{\\forall A\\exists Y\\;\\mathsf{Jump}(A,Y)\\};\\mathrm{RCA}_0).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>正向用算术理解形成相对停机集。反向将一个理解实例的有限集合参数 join 为 A，按该固定算术公式的有限数值量词层数做有限次跳跃；该定义类递归于所得 oracle，故 RCA₀ 的 Δ⁰₁ 理解形成它。每次实例仅需要有限标准层数，不推出统一的 ω 跳跃集。与原书 TJ 的有效编号差异由均匀相对归约消去。</p>\n<p>来源：第二版（2009），Exercise VIII.1.12; Remark I.3.4；纸面页 313, 8；PDF 页 331, 26。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"62-df-RCA0","status":"resolved","id":"dd5e8930337c8b20","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[62-df-RCA0]]","embed":false},{"target":"62-df-ACA0","status":"resolved","id":"35af454d9caa8c9d","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[62-df-ACA0]]","embed":false},{"target":"62-df-jump-operator","status":"resolved","id":"d4d648cbb987de36","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[62-df-jump-operator]]","embed":false},{"target":"62-df-oracle-computation","status":"resolved","id":"06104e9b3d35ed9d","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[62-df-oracle-computation]]","embed":false},{"target":"62-df-turing-join","status":"resolved","id":"5d451f45281e1b22","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[62-df-turing-join]]","embed":false},{"target":"62-df-equivalence-over-base","status":"resolved","id":"781620ab41bfeebd","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[62-df-equivalence-over-base]]","emb